ite_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":7619584,"digest":"sha256:b89dcee0f75dd5b7b57559c66867101ee35418b05579557d380a030bbf74e581","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-22T23:05:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:05:28Z"},{"id":667343682,"node_id":"RA_kwDOM7BPMc4nxttC","name":"msb-windows-aarch64.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":39804416,"digest":"sha256:aa2954ae7cab69123bc7fb93d91fd831688e75cc92d8688d3d811500e459b97a","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-22T23:05:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:05:30Z"},{"id":667343710,"node_id":"RA_kwDOM7BPMc4nxtte","name":"msb-windows-x86_64.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":46947840,"digest":"sha256:b99b2a67d1c7ec290f2ceb07f401039b6d29dcdb998de7982291f008f94d2d07","download_count":7,"created_at":"2026-10-22T23:05:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:05:31Z"}],"body":"<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.7.9 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Features\n* feat(modify): add and remove published ports by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1789\n* feat(sdk): expose retained sandbox exit outcomes by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1812\n* feat(network): return JSON policy denials by default by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1825\n* feat(exec): add optional output backpressure by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1832\n* feat(sdk): apply label modifications live on running sandboxes by @TheRealSibasishBehera in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1881\n* feat(config): restrict backends and add context commands by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1898\n* feat(network): add HTTP CONNECT proxy basic authentication - #78 by @gregwebs in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1868\n### Fixes\n* fix(db): preserve SQLite locks during macOS identity checks by @x0day in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1787\n* fix(snapshot): avoid duplicate catalog entries after import by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1802\n* fix(runtime): take metrics snapshots off the runtime workers by @0xpolarzero in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1807\n* fix(exec): reject signals promptly after execution ends by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1810\n* fix(runtime): discard late bulk finishes after cancellation by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1816\n* fix(network): release completed published TCP connections by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1815\n* fix(cli): shorten default storage usage output by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1820\n* fix(runtime): deliver bulk failures without waiting for finish by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1822\n* fix(runtime): preserve live legacy startup endpoints by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1823\n* fix(network): preserve ipv4 fallback when ipv6 stalls by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1824\n* fix(installer): resolve relative install paths before changing directory by @GoldArowana in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1830\n* fix(runtime): preserve partial relay frame reads across wakeups by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1838\n* fix(agentd): replace the CA bundle atomically by @TheRealSibasishBehera in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1856\n* fix(sdk): refuse reserved label keys in modify by @TheRealSibasishBehera in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1857\n* fix(sdk-node): encode consumer paths when resolving bundled binaries by @GoldArowana in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1833\n* fix(sdk): refuse env the guest cannot boot with by @TheRealSibasishBehera in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1863\n* fix(cli): keep secret substitution on plain modify by @TheRealSibasishBehera in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1842\n* fix(volume): retain local record until file removal succeeds by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1873\n* fix(ci): improve runner disk cleanup by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1895\n* fix(exec): bound command buffers without stalling shared transport by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1839\n* fix(env): set the last entry of a repeated env key by @TheRealSibasishBehera in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1893\n* fix(snapshot): inspect archive metadata before deferred extraction by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1903\n### Documentation\n* docs: sync mintlify updates to main by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1814\n* docs(cli): list secret options in command help by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1828\n* docs: sync published mintlify updates into main by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1885\n### Dependencies\n* chore(deps): Bump the \"dependencies\" group with 2 updates across multiple ecosystems by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1853\n* chore(deps): bump webpki deps by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1894\n* chore(deps-dev): Bump the npm_and_yarn group across 2 directories with 1 update by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1892\n* chore(deps): Bump @vitest/mocker from 5.0.1 to 5.0.5 in /packages in the npm_and_yarn group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1896\n### Build\n* build(kernel): update firmware to Linux 6.12.113 by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1876\n### Tests\n* test(network): cover HTTP CONNECT handshake and harden status parsing by @gregwebs in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1819\n### Maintenance\n* chore: refresh lockfiles after v0.7.8 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1808\n* chore(docs): add documentation skill by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1869\n* chore(release): bump microsandbox to 0.7.9 by @appcypher in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1829\n### Other changes\n* revert(exec): remove unreleased output backpressure by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1875\n\n## New Contributors\n* @GoldArowana made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1830\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/compare/v0.7.8...v0.7.9","mentions_count":8}
